-     - `GL_TEXTURE_WRAP_T`: `GL_CLAMP_TO_EDGE` [S1, unofficial].
-   - Unbind the texture (bind to `0`).
-
-3. **Framebuffer Attachment:**
-   - Bind the target FBO.
